cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SenseLex: offline-first, browser-based collection of multisensory lexical norms across languages and scripts"
abstract: >-
  An open-source suite for collecting, analysing and sharing multisensory
  lexical norms across languages and scripts. A self-contained browser edition
  runs with no installation, account or server; a companion service adds shared
  collection with idempotent synchronisation and FAIR exports; a jsPsych plugin
  and exporter connect the instrument to existing experiment pipelines.
type: software
